{"ID":"20240118151020-u8p0xum","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151020-u8p0xum","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151020-u8p0xum\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151020-0evw5dv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122151856-656vgb5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122151856-656vgb5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:79,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:79\u0026#125;","title":"275旋复花（旋覆花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204085913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151020-0evw5dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151020-0evw5dv","updated":"20240122151750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名筋根花，一名金沸。味甘，温，无毒。主益气，去面黑，色媚好。其根，味辛，治腹中寒热邪气，利小便。久服不饥，轻身。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151754-zy43vta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151754-zy43vta"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产原野湿地，各处有之，园圃亦可栽植，亦名金钱花。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151756-3ua4g9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151756-3ua4g9f"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性温，无毒（或作有小毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151757-uvi4b20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151757-uvi4b20"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】旋覆花为下气祛痰健胃行水要药，主治肺胃气虚，痰水胶结，上气喘急，根能续筋断[续断更好。]。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151801-qf5s2r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151801-qf5s2r4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"[ "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151815-6kkw8x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151815-6kkw8x4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"1.旋覆花常与代锗石并用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151811-j3z6n5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151811-j3z6n5s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"2.制胃酸。仅使用在热症。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151814-koq9tn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151814-koq9tn7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"3.旋覆花、半夏汤止打嗝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151817-apxlwrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151817-apxlwrz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"] "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151820-lkksxif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151820-lkksxif"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】消胸上痰结，唾如胶漆，心胸痰水，膀胱留饮，风气湿痹，皮间死肉，利大肠，通血脉，益色泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151823-ka87cca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151823-ka87cca"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】主水肿，逐大腹，开胃，止呕逆不下食。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151824-wovr04h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151824-wovr04h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】降气消痰。【用量】普通一钱至二、三钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151826-vy0dk4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151826-vy0dk4q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】病人涉虚者，忌多服，冷利大肠，虚寒人禁用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151827-g2s0t15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151827-g2s0t15"}},{"ID":"20240122151828-8e2wn57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151828-8e2wn57"}},{"ID":"20240122151828-v0smo4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151828-v0smo4m","updated":"20240204085637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个二百七十五，我们讲旋复花。平常我们——过去的古字就是“覆”，现在我们没有加这个“覆”，旋覆花。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花呢，我们常常跟前面的赤色的代赭石，并用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。看看这个旋覆花长的样子，这里，长这个样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151834-qpv479m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151834-qpv479m","updated":"20240204085630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要的功能呢，它能够下气，胃气上升能够冲上，打嗝嗝气上来，下气祛痰，能够健胃行水，所以我们能够健胃，胃里面胃气不足，我们可以用旋覆花，我用了很多，行水，还有我们可以制它的酸，这个念“制”，控制的制，制酸，所以我在国外用的很多，来的病人胃酸很多，旋覆花代赭石汤一剂下去，就中了，无一不好，那这个是使用的热症，热症的肠胃。尤其，因为代赭石本身味道是寒凉的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151844-37242wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151844-37242wf","updated":"20240204085734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那旋覆花呢，诸位看，又有一个名字叫“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金沸草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，所以你以后看到金沸草就是指旋覆花。金沸草。你如果说到药房去，你找金沸草三钱，旋覆花三钱，实际上你拿的会是一样的东西。有的药房呢只认得旋覆花，不认得金沸草，所以你说金沸草没有，旋覆花有，就会有这种情形出现，那是老师傅没有教好，他的师傅没有把他教好！"}]},{"ID":"20240122151849-d5t23as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151849-d5t23as","updated":"20240204085823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它的【性味】味咸，性温，无毒。旋覆花的下气祛痰，主治，肺胃的气虚，这个虚不是那个虚啊，是虚实的虚，痰水胶结，它的根能够续筋，续筋断。你说旋覆花的根能够续筋，我直接写续断，不是更好吗？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旁治，续筋断。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151855-9584llk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151855-9584llk","updated":"20240204085842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别录】呢，消胸上痰结，唾如胶漆，痰很胶，如硬块一样，都可以使用它。这个主呕逆，【甄权】主水肿，逐大腹，腹胀，呕逆不下食。一般来说，只要是这个肚子恶心，东西吃不下，你都可以使用到旋覆花，因为旋覆花本身是热性的，代赭石是比较寒凉的，如果说，你用半夏来止呕，旋覆花来降气，就可以治疗什么打嗝，哦对症。如果寒很重，恶心很重，你可以用什么？吴茱萸、干姜之类的东西。这个旋覆花降气消痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151856-656vgb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151856-656vgb5","updated":"20240204085913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方剂量呢，一般来说两钱、三钱就很多了，因为它是花类的，质很轻，就像我刚才讲的，你只要听了大概胃酸太多，就可以用旋覆花了。在临床上用的非常的多，非常的广泛。"}]}]}